$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM General procedure (GP) for the syntheses of 3-12 (Liebeskind-Srogl
Crosscoupling) BODIPY 3. An oven-dry round bottom flask, equipped with a
stir bar, was charged with thiomethylbodipy 1 (40 mg, 0.168 mmol, 1
equiv), 4-(diphenylamino)phenylboronic acid (146 mg, 0.504 mmol, 3 equiv)
and anhydrous THF (20 mL) under N2. The stirred solution was sparged with
N2 for 10 min., whereupon Pd2dba3 (3.8 mg, 4.2 μmol, 2.5 mol%),
tri(2-furyl)phosphine (2.9 mg, 12.6 μmol, 7.5 mol%) and copper(I)
thiophene-2-carboxylate (96 mg, 0.504 mmol, 3 equiv) were added followed
by 5 min N2-purge. The reaction mixture was heated at 55 °C. The reaction
was monitored by TLC (Rf = 0.44, SiO2-gel, 20% EtOAc/hexanes), which
showed that the reaction was finished after 1.5 h. The reaction mixture
was allowed to reach r.t. and was adsorbed on SiO2-gel. After flash
chromatography (SiO2-gel, EtOAc/hexanes gradient) purification, followed
by washings with petroleum ether (3 x 2 mL), 3 (72 mg, 0.165 mmol, 98%)
was obtained as a purple solid BODIPY 3, yield (72 mg, 0.165 mmol, 98%)
(mp: 212-214 °C); 1H NMR (200 MHz, CDCl3) δ 7.90 (s, 2H), 7.49-7.31 (m,
6H), 7.24-7.05 (m, 10H), 6.55 (dd, J1 = 4.0 Hz, J2 = 1.8 Hz, 2H); 13C NMR
(50 MHz, CDCl3) δ 151.1, 147.7, 146.6, 142.9, 134.8, 132.5, 131.3, 129.9,
126.4, 126.1, 124.9, 120.2, 118.2; IR (KBr, cm-1) 3105 (w), 3059 (w),
3036 (w), 1587 (s), 1558 (s), 1533 (s), 1488 (s), 1412 (s), 1388 (s),
1332 (m), 1294 (m), 1261 (s), 1224 (m), 1192 (m), 1118 (s), 1076 (s), 980
(s), 911 (m), 757 (m), 742 (m), 696 (m). HRMS FABS (M+H+) Calcd for
C27H21BF2N3: 436.1796. Found: 436.1791.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM Novel meso-Polyarylamine-BODIPY Hybrids: Synthesis and Study of Their
Optical Properties
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):AUTHOR
$DATUM Lager, Erik; Liu, Jianzhao; Aguilar-Aguilar, Angelica; Tang, Ben Zhong;
Pena-Cabrera, Eduardo
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):CITATION
$DATUM Journal of Organic Chemistry (2009), 74(5), 2053-2058

