2-Benzyl-3-chloro-6-(3,4-dimethoxyphenyl)-5-methylpyrazine (9j) Colorless
oil; yield: 111 mg (0.4 mmol, 80%). 1HNMR (300 MHz, CDCl3): δ = 7.37-7.21
(m, 5 H), 7.18-7.14 (m, 2 H), 6.96 (d,J= 7.92 Hz, 1 H),4.32 (s, 2 H),
3.94 (s, 3 H), 3.91 (s, 3 H), 2.61 (s, 3 H). 13CNMR (75 MHz, CDCl3): δ =
151.0, 150.4, 149.7, 149.0, 148.8, 144.9, 137.5, 130.0, 129.1, 128.4,
126.6, 121.8, 112.4, 110.7, 55.9 (2 C), 40.6,22.6. HRMS (EI): m/z [M]
calcd for C20H19ClN2O2: 354.1135; found: 354.1145.
